					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tua omnia bona fide accepi (reverende in Christo pater) <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et tantum me tibi debere fateor quantum nemini <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nunc quidem mortalium.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cum tua legerem, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>succurrebat illud psalmographi: "Verum tamen <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>oculis tuis considerabis et retributionem peccatorum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>videbis."</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Remitto caetera; unicum exemplar retinui, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quod non praeter voluntatem tuam fecisse arbitror, quo <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>expeditius ad fratres transmittere possum et <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>eos communi impertire gaudio.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quae <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>mandas, mihi curae cordique erunt; nihil certe <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>studii et diligentiae praetermittam, scribam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l93">Clavennam</placeName>, in <placeName ref="l638">Engadinam</placeName> et <placeName ref="l520">Valletelinam</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hic <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>etiam per alios non suspectos apud papistas in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>illa inquiri curabo.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nunc plane novi nihil <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Occupor ego circa orationem scribendam, qua <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>rationem et ipse reddere cogito, cur sine scelere <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><placeName ref="l1107">Tridentinum</placeName> concilium a christianis frequentari <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nequeat.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Scio ego me nullas novas rationes <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>afferre, sed existimo <placeName ref="l425">Romanam</placeName> tyrannidem com<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>munibus copiis expugnandam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si fieri potest (l... <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>autem, ut fieri possit) inter alias mea occupationes, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>absolvam, ut in proxime futura synodo eam cum fratribus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>conferam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tu, quaeso, nos de <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName> rebus edocere <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>pro tua singulari in nos humanitate perge.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Bene mereris de nostris ecclesiis, quae non mediocrite<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>r harum rerum cognitione iuvantur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>reverende in Christo pater, cum tuis omnibus quam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>felicissime et diutissime.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 11. maii <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>anno 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Tui <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>observans <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Amplissimo viro eruditio<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ne et pietate singulari <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et patrono <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>